{
  "id": "fox-double-laser",
  "name": "Double laser",
  "part": "tech",
  "characters": [
    "fox"
  ],
  "goal": "Two lasers in one short hop.",
  "why": "Lasers do damage from a distance without hitstun, and from a short hop Fox is back on the ground soon after firing. Two lasers in one short hop double the damage of each hop, and an opponent who keeps losing damage to them has to approach.",
  "tutorial": {
    "camera": {
      "follow": "player",
      "distance": 90,
      "height": 8
    },
    "what": "A short hop double laser is B on the first frame in the air and B again {3} to {13} frames later. The blaster loops once more, and its second laser fires on the frame Fox lands.",
    "expect": "Each short hop is judged when Fox lands: the hop, the frame of the first B, and how many lasers fired before landing. After misses, the coach shows your inputs frame by frame against these frames.",
    "example": [
      {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "press": "B",
        "frame": "J+1",
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "press": "B",
        "frame": "J+4",
        "hold": 1
      }
    ],
    "marks": {
      "1": "Frame 1: X tapped. Short hop",
      "J+1": "Frame {J+1}: B. The blaster comes out",
      "J+4": "Frame {J+4}: B again. The blaster will loop",
      "13": "Frame {13}: the first laser",
      "23": "Frame {23}: landing. The second laser"
    },
    "lessons": [
      {
        "title": "The blaster in the air",
        "text": [
          "B in the air starts the blaster: {4} frames of startup, then a {10}-frame loop that fires the laser on its sixth frame, {9} frames after B.",
          "B pressed again from the blaster's frame {4} to its frame {14} makes the loop run once more, and a second laser fires {10} frames after the first. B pressed sooner is not seen; from frame {15} the blaster is being put away and B does nothing."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "B",
                "frame": "J+1",
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "B",
                "frame": "J+4",
                "hold": 1
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: X tapped",
              "J+1": "Frame {J+1}: B. Blaster frame 1",
              "J+2": "Frame {f}: startup. B now is not seen",
              "J+4": "Frame {J+4}: B again, blaster frame {4}",
              "13": "Frame {13}: the first laser",
              "18": "Frame {f}: the second loop",
              "23": "Frame {23}: the second laser"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  1,
                  "J"
                ],
                "words": "Jump squat: B is not seen",
                "kind": "late"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+1",
                  "J+1"
                ],
                "words": "B now",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+2",
                  "J+3"
                ],
                "words": "Startup: B is not seen",
                "kind": "late"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+4",
                  17
                ],
                "words": "Press B again now",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  18,
                  22
                ],
                "words": "Second loop",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  23,
                  30
                ],
                "words": "Second laser, landing",
                "kind": "info"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Two in one short hop",
        "text": [
          "The second laser fires {19} frames after the first B. Landing puts the blaster away, but a laser due on the landing frame still fires.",
          "With the blaster out, the short hop lands on frame {23} after a first B on frame {4}, and on frame {25} after one on frame {5} or {6}. So the first B must come within the first {3} frames in the air, and a fast fall lands Fox too early."
        ],
        "show": {
          "still": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "B",
                "frame": "J+1",
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "B",
                "frame": "J+4",
                "hold": 1
              }
            ],
            "frame": 23,
            "cue": {
              "words": "Frame {23}: landing. The second laser fires",
              "kind": "info"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "name": "On the stage",
      "stage": "final-destination",
      "player": {
        "x": -60
      },
      "opponent": "none",
      "camera": {
        "follow": "player",
        "distance": 220,
        "height": 10
      }
    }
  ],
  "attempt": {
    "start": {
      "enters": "jump_squat"
    },
    "judge": "lands",
    "limit": 60,
    "timeout": "judge"
  },
  "measures": {
    "kind": "jump_kind",
    "lasered": {
      "happened": {
        "enters": "laser"
      }
    },
    "laser_frame": {
      "frame_of": {
        "enters": "laser"
      }
    },
    "shots": {
      "count": {
        "is": "shot",
        "from": "laser"
      }
    }
  },
  "verdict": {
    "success": "Two lasers. First B on frame {laser_frame}."
  },
  "checks": {
    "short hop": {
      "measure": "kind",
      "equals": "short",
      "expect": "A short hop",
      "words": "a {measure} hop",
      "headline": "Full hop",
      "fix": "Tap X or Y: release it within {J-1} frames."
    },
    "laser": {
      "measure": "lasered",
      "equals": true,
      "expect": "A laser in the air",
      "words": "{char} landed without a laser",
      "headline": "No laser",
      "fix": "Press B once {char} is off the ground, on frame {J+1}. B pressed during the jump squat is not seen."
    },
    "early laser": {
      "measure": "laser_frame",
      "at_most": "J+3",
      "expect": "The first B on frame {J+1}, {J+2} or {J+3}",
      "words": "first B on frame {measure}",
      "headline": "Late first laser",
      "fix": "Press B on frame {J+1}, the first frame in the air. From frame {J+4} on, the short hop lands before the second laser can fire."
    },
    "two lasers": {
      "measure": "shots",
      "at_least": 2,
      "expect": "Two lasers before landing",
      "words": "{measure} laser fired before landing",
      "headline": "One laser",
      "fix": "Press B again {3} to {13} frames after the first, and do not fast fall. The blaster loops once more and fires the second laser {19} frames after the first B, and Fox must not land before that frame."
    }
  },
  "parts": [
